{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You want to start playing. The game is loading. BOOM... glitches everywhere, assets couldn't load properly, and even the controls are messed up.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But, somehow the game is still letting you play. Now you have to find your way through the glitchy world of Sequence Jump, where nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your controls are restricted: Aside from movement, you only have one button that is working. But still, you have to use different abilities. How? Your action button is constantly re-wired, either by the game, or by yourself!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Levels. Damn!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Ways to Re-wire your Action Button. Exciting!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Abilities. Mind-Blowing!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Minutes of Gameplay (its more, but we needed another 4). Oof!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hidden Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find the hidden content? Hint: Look at the 5th screenshot!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3860720?t=1755499396","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3860720?t=1755499396","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860720/543b1b34b4cc9d7583be64070897a21973f9dfdc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755499396","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860720/543b1b34b4cc9d7583be64070897a21973f9dfdc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755499396","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You want to start playing. The game is loading. BOOM... glitches everywhere, assets couldn't load properly, and even the controls are messed up.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But, somehow the game is still letting you play. Now you have to find your way through the glitchy world of Sequence Jump, where nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your controls are restricted: Aside from movement, you only have one button that is working. But still, you have to use different abilities. How? Your action button is constantly re-wired, either by the game, or by yourself!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Levels. Damn!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Ways to Re-wire your Action Button. Exciting!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Abilities. Mind-Blowing!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Minutes of Gameplay (its more, but we needed another 4). Oof!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hidden Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find the hidden content? Hint: Look at the 5th screenshot!</p>","developers":["Sagewing Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3860610","name":"Sequence Jump"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860720/357435e77379246eef0ea3c49875faab734d7e42/header.jpg?t=1755499396","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Sequence Jump Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Proces